r business. Chris was not only able to help us streamline our operations throughout Asia and shorten our time to market, but through his willingness to negotiate great rates on our behalf, also provide significant cost savings. For anyone looking for a freight agent who is always available and ready to assist in anyway possible, then I cannot recommend Chris Lebon and United Carriers any higher."]},{"tag":"p","attrs":{},"children":["‍"]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","attrs":{"class":"home-testi-stick-block"},"children":[]}]}]}